      "created_at": "2013-10-22T05:46:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Chastise would be destroyed since Fanatic is unable to deal herself any damage.</p><p>An exception to this is stuff like Wraith's Stun Bolt and Nightmist's Investigation. Since the secondary effects of reduce damage by 1 and draw 2 cards are not inherent on damage being done, even with something like Meteor Storm out, you could still have the secondary effect of both powers.</p>",
